# Cloudflare redirects. Syntax: /from  /to  status
#
# The Astro slugs match the old WordPress paths 1:1, and Cloudflare's static-
# asset handler auto-drops trailing slashes (so /about-fostering/ -> /about-fostering
# and /resources/<slug>/ -> /resources/<slug> resolve without rules here).
# These cover common aliases / shortcuts that may be linked externally.

/home/        /                                  301
/contact      /contact-us                        301
/contact/     /contact-us                        301
/complaints   /program-description/complaints     301
/complaints/  /program-description/complaints     301
/blog         /resources                         301
/blog/        /resources                         301
/thank-you    /thank-you-fostering               301
/thank-you/   /thank-you-fostering               301
